(text "TI TPS26631 PWPR Fig9-2-derived power stage: 10..32V; OV <=36 via R201..203, 58V 350ms only certified conditioned input <60V incl ringing. ILIM nominal3A. Q201 body diode orientation, Q202 fast off, external F_MAIN. TPS26631 industrial NOT AEC, thermals/ESD/RAW/USB/open-pin/temperature NOT qualified." (at 27.94 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016))) (uuid "b63a0921-7362-49b4-b250-000000180148"))
(text "R201=402k R202=49k9 R203=16k5: OV rise 34.07V typ / 32.34..35.86V modeled limits, UV rise 8.47V typ. Need verify OVP leak/TCR/tol, 10V loaded start, 32V survival; not production. No extra 200V high voltage network." (at 27.94 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016))) (uuid "b63a0921-7362-49b4-b250-000000180149"))
(text "WARNING: 58V at connector must already include wiring overshoots. eFuse ABS 67V, MAX recommended 60V. TMP 85C safe-off not implemented, must be implemented before FAB. RAW testpad not 0.5A-rated connector." (at 27.94 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016))) (uuid "b63a0921-7362-49b4-b250-000000180150"))

